<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Perlis 1996 net down 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Perlis 1996 net down 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 179.08   vs	 219.06</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 48.7    vs	  59.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		 5,878.36   vs     6,106.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   347.26   vs	 392.08</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  93.88   vs  less 117.56</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   43.25   vs	  15.27</p>
<p>    Dividend  (pct)	   16.0    vs	  16.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Perlis Plantations Bhd. The company's operations include flour milling, animal feed and edible oil refining.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
